WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Start with the CLI.
Real commands from this build.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
vukem version
The CLI that generated the example.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Create the app.
vukem new money --example finance --seed

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The database is ready.
vukem migrate, then the finance seeders.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Every route, listed.
vukem route:list

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
vukem serve
The generated app listens locally.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Auth
Google is offered only when both credentials are set.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Database
Transactions persist integer cents.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:06.000
Security
A nonce CSP, sessions, and CSRF.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:14.000
CLI
Generators and installers from vukem.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:22.000
APIs
install:api adds tokens, CORS, and rate limiting.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Vukem Studio
A read-only browser for the project databases.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:38.000
The example SaaS.
Personal finance, generated by that command.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:46.000
Make room for what matters.
The public landing.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:54.000
Your money, at a glance.
Income, expenses, and balance.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:02:01.000
Every detail counts.
Add and edit transactions.

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:08.000
A place for every account.
The books stay in one workspace.
